#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""tieitup: TieItUp's changed-line check, its whole-file jobs and its record.

check reads only the lines a change adds and prints one line per finding;
audit, debt, gain and help do the jobs of Ponytail's other skills; mark, miss
and learn keep a record of the check's own mistakes and turn it into
proposals. Every command exits 0 so the check can never block an edit, a
commit or a turn; only a usage error exits 2. Python 3.9 standard library.
"""
